#: ../../source/native-mcp_SKILL.md:13
msgid "Native MCP Client"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/native-mcp_SKILL.md:15
msgid ""
"Hermes Agent has a built-in MCP client that connects to MCP servers at "
"startup, discovers their tools, and makes them available as first-class "
"tools the agent can call directly. No bridge CLI needed -- tools from MCP"
" servers appear alongside built-in tools like `terminal`, `read_file`, "
"etc."
msgstr ""

